 "0a4fc336": "Extracting a ZIP: 10,000 files",
 "162b2359": "Each app opens the same folders in turn; time, CPU and memory are measured. Other apps' windows open and close during the test: don't touch the mouse or keyboard. It takes about 5–10 minutes; the test files are made the first time (~1.3 GB, in local app data).",
 "f52afac8": "Medians of 3 runs (a warm-up run isn't counted). Time: from starting the app until its window stops changing for 500 ms. * The app was already running: CPU counts from when the window appeared, memory is the whole process.",
 "252ff602": "smoothyfiles is free and made by one person. If you like it, star it on GitHub: it helps others find it.",
